Upstream license ambiguity
--------------------------

The Mate-Engine X3.3.0 README describes the application license as
"Mixed — GNU AGPL v3 & MateProv2 License." The upstream repository does not
provide the GNU AGPL v3 text or a file-by-file map between AGPL and MateEngine
Pro components. The MateEngine Pro License v2.1 in this repository licenses
waifu-agent-authored work; it does not establish the license of an upstream
Mate-Engine file.

Before importing any Mate-Engine source, the importer must obtain written
confirmation of that file's license or establish it from an authoritative
file-level notice. AGPL-covered source must not be imported until its
compatibility and corresponding obligations have been reviewed and recorded.

